[[File:Screenshot 2014-01-06-16-56-01.png|thumb|Berserker Cat unleashing a Critical Hit.]]
:''Not to be confused with [[Savage Blow]] or [[Metal Killer]].''
'''Critical Hits''' (also known as '''Critical Attacks''' or just '''Criticals''') are a [[Special Abilities|Special Ability]] in [[The Battle Cats]]. They can be created by certain [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Cat Units]] and [[:Category:Critical Hit Enemies|Enemy Units]] at a set chance.

This powerful attack deals '''double''' the damage of a regular attack and ignores the "[[Metal]]" ability, Critical Hits still do double damage to Metal enemies. This makes the ability particularly effective against [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemies, as they take only 1 damage from attacks otherwise, but generally do not have enough health to withstand Critical Hits. Although they are few and far between, [[:Category:Critical Hit Enemies|Enemies]] such as [[R.Ost]] or [[Capy]] also possess the ability to perform Critical Hits, making them extra dangerous and rendering [[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Cat]] useless against them.

When a Cat or Enemy lands a Critical Hit, a sparkling star effect appears with a unique sound cue. In the case that a unit can perform both Critical Hits as well as [[Wave Attack]]s or [[Surge Attack]]s, every opposing unit that was hit from the Wave or Surge will also be affected, this is most notable in [[Kubiluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Kubiluga's]] [[True Form]] and [[Backhoe Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Backhoe Cat's]] True Form.

